  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit pairs human isolation style with hairy man heaven and earth style as refinement path’s two styles. Hairy man refinement that uses heaven and earth dao marks has a higher Immortal Gu success rate than human isolation style.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "race_hairy_men",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking only at human isolation style, chances of refining a rank six Immortal Gu are often less than one percent.",
      "chapters": [
        1060
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Yu Mu Chun dies, Shadow Sect gives up hairy man heaven and earth style and uses human isolation style to refine Fixed Immortal Travel, calling the success rate quite low.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fixed-immortal-travel-attempt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_mu_chun",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with a Gu formation, eight failures show human isolation style’s lower success rate compared with hairy man heaven and earth style.",
      "chapters": [
        1067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fixed-immortal-travel-attempt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After trouble with hairy man heaven and earth style, Fang Yuan swears not to use it next time and finds human isolation style wonderful for that moment.",
      "chapters": [
        1068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-preference",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under his later request, Lang Ya land spirit uses human isolation style instead of hairy man heaven and earth style, because heaven’s will is watching and using that style might have made refinement fail regardless.",
      "chapters": [
        1385
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-preference",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit is most skilled in hairy man heaven and earth style, but that style would never succeed in refining Fang Yuan’s Gu, because it draws heaven’s will and even heavenly tribulations or earthly calamities; only human isolation style has a chance of success, though Lang Ya land spirit does not know this and is not himself skilled in it.",
      "chapters": [
        1396
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "only-style-with-a-chance-on-fang-yuans-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
